  Length: 13
  Dialogue:
  - Good Evening everyone and welcome to the last 2 minutes of 1999
  - Many concerts are going on around the city, but right at the center of town we
    have quite the treat
  - The Viral Boy Band 0n-Lyne with their new hit single "Party of Your Lifetime"
  - Oh!! it looks like the show is about to begin
  - We're broadcating this song everywhere. TVs, Radios, even in our news helicopter
    right now
  - What do you think of the song Maverick?
  - ...
  - It looks like hes not a fan everybody, he looks like he's shaking with anger
  - SHUT THE HELL UP ASHLEY, IM TRYING TO LISTEN TO THE SONG
  - WELL NOW YOURE JUST BEING UNPROFESSIONAL
  - You just bring out this ANGER in me
  - KEEP THE COPTER STABLE IDIOT
  - STOP PRESSING BUTTONS THEN
  OtherSpeakers:
  - Pilot
